(20, 6, 2, 'Heat the frying oil.', 'Oil stable at 180°C ±3.', 'OK: all 2 actions passed'),
(21, 6, 3, 'Fry prawns and vegetables in batches of 6 pieces.', 'Light, crispy, pale golden coating.
